# Youthful Valkyrie: "Whenever another Angel you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Bot1 casts a Valkyrie,
# an Ornithopter (not an Angel: no counter) and a second Valkyrie (another Angel: the first one gets a counter; the second does
# not, since it is not "another" to itself). Bot2 then casts its own Valkyrie, an Angel Bot1 does not control: no counter either.
# The first Valkyrie ends with exactly one counter (2/4).

